{"unit_id":"dmz2922990__dsh-ssh#card-zh","repo":"dmz2922990/dsh-ssh","commit":"1c599052ed9e6598c1191308fde82d2d5afe17ea","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 SSH 主机管理与远程执行插件。它在 DSH 中注册 ssh.hosts 服务及一组模型工具，并在 Web 设置页加入 SSH 主机面板。用户可维护主机清单、通过 ssh_bash 执行远程脚本，并用 ssh_upload 和 ssh_download 传输文件；远程 shell 默认优先 bash，也可指定 sh 或 ash。适合需要从 DSH 会话管理多台 SSH 主机、运行命令或交换文件的开发与运维场景。使用时需提供可访问的 SSH 主机和相应认证信息，插件将主机配置保存在本机用户目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:22-24","index.mjs:351-357","index.mjs:454-500","client.js:249-259"]}
{"unit_id":"dmz2922990__dsh-ssh#card-en","repo":"dmz2922990/dsh-ssh","commit":"1c599052ed9e6598c1191308fde82d2d5afe17ea","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ssh manages SSH hosts in DSH Web. It provides host tools and a settings panel. Run scripts with ssh_bash and transfer files with ssh_upload or ssh_download. Bash, sh, and ash are supported. Configure reachable SSH hosts and authentication; settings are stored locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:22-24","index.mjs:351-357","index.mjs:454-500","client.js:249-259"]}
