{"unit_id":"dmz2922990__dsh-ssh#feature-host-management","repo":"dmz2922990/dsh-ssh","commit":"1c599052ed9e6598c1191308fde82d2d5afe17ea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh 的功能「主机清单」：通过 SSH 主机工具添加、查看、编辑、复制或删除主机，并维护其连接和认证配置。主机数据保存在本地配置文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:351-351","index.mjs:357-452"]}
{"unit_id":"dmz2922990__dsh-ssh#feature-remote-command","repo":"dmz2922990/dsh-ssh","commit":"1c599052ed9e6598c1191308fde82d2d5afe17ea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh 的功能「远程脚本」：调用 ssh_bash 并指定主机及脚本，即可通过 SSH 在远端运行多行命令；默认优先 bash，也能选择 sh 或 ash，并返回退出状态、标准输出和错误输出。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:454-470","index.mjs:90-119"]}
{"unit_id":"dmz2922990__dsh-ssh#feature-upload","repo":"dmz2922990/dsh-ssh","commit":"1c599052ed9e6598c1191308fde82d2d5afe17ea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh 的功能「上传文件」：调用 ssh_upload 提供本地文件、SSH 主机和远端目标路径，将文件通过 SSH 传输到远端；目标父目录会自动创建，单个文件限制为 128 MB。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:161-162","index.mjs:225-254","index.mjs:472-487"]}
{"unit_id":"dmz2922990__dsh-ssh#feature-download","repo":"dmz2922990/dsh-ssh","commit":"1c599052ed9e6598c1191308fde82d2d5afe17ea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh 的功能「下载文件」：调用 ssh_download 提供 SSH 主机、远端文件路径和本地目标路径，将远端文件传回本机；本地路径可以是目录或完整文件路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:256-285","index.mjs:489-505"]}
{"unit_id":"dmz2922990__dsh-ssh#feature-settings-panel","repo":"dmz2922990/dsh-ssh","commit":"1c599052ed9e6598c1191308fde82d2d5afe17ea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh 的功能「Web 设置面板」：在 DSH Web 客户端的设置区域显示「SSH 主机」页面，可添加、编辑、复制和删除主机，测试远程命令并提交文件上传或下载。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:249-259","index.mjs:507-580"]}
